NetBSD-current now has support for the new generation of alpha
processors:  systems based on the ev6 (21264) cpu.

I did the work on a 264dp, but it should also work on most of the
currently available ev6 servers and workstations. Please try and boot
it on any such systems you have access to and let me know about the
results!

